---
/**
 * Founder photo: /public/assets/founder/founder-photo.jpg
 * Supplied by the client and used as-is — cropped/framed for layout only,
 * no retouching, no alteration of the person's likeness.
 */
---
<section class="founder section--paper">
  <div class="container founder-inner">
    <div class="founder-media">
      <img
        src="/assets/founder/founder-photo.jpg"
        alt="Portrait of the founder of ROAN"
        width="460"
        height="512"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="founder-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">The person behind ROAN</span>
      <h2>Why ROAN exists</h2>
      <p>
        ROAN was created with a simple idea: make it easier to discover products, tools and ideas
        that are genuinely worth considering. Every pick on this site is chosen and written with
        that same standard in mind — useful over hyped, honest over exaggerated.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .founder-media {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }
  .founder-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }
  .founder-copy p {
    max-width: 56ch;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .founder-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .founder-media {
      max-width: 260px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
